{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/7517acdddc4f20626e185a444d41f26d.avif?t=1759882352\" width=616 height=253 /></span><br><i>Serra de Deus is a simulation and exploration game with elements of psychological horror. It features a retro aesthetic inspired by the PS1 era. The story takes place in a favela in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years of living in the big city, <strong>David de Lima decides to return to his hometown of Rio de Janeiro, where he takes over his family's humble hot dog stand.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/2624c13f2f36bc0cbdb32337f99816b4.poster.avif?t=1759882352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/2624c13f2f36bc0cbdb32337f99816b4.webm?t=1759882352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/2624c13f2f36bc0cbdb32337f99816b4.mp4?t=1759882352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, peace doesn\u2019t last long. David soon realizes things have changed\u2014a series of strange murders has occurred, and the more David investigates, the more questions arise; <strong>These crimes don\u2019t seem to have been committed by gangs or ordinary criminals, but by something far darker: a mysterious group of cultists.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/650a1794678da7afc8c7247fe0df9474.poster.avif?t=1759882352\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/650a1794678da7afc8c7247fe0df9474.webm?t=1759882352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/extras/650a1794678da7afc8c7247fe0df9474.mp4?t=1759882352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation:</strong> Play as David\u2014go to work, earn money, buy furniture to upgrade your home, meet people, make decisions, play mini-games, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Exploration Map:</strong> A fully interactive map open for exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Linear Story:</strong> Multiple endings depending on the choices made throughout the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Play from start to finish seamlessly with your preferred gamepad or controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility Options:</strong> Various accessibility features to help players with disabilities enjoy the experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868630?t=1759882352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/b2fd7462fb3856098f7a3efb7476e5a0f94ff419/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759882352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/86852145a7cf1002c404fec87ff687724604651e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759882352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868630/86852145a7cf1002c404fec87ff687724604651e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759882352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"descriptio